============================================================
MESSAGING RULE
============================================================

Atlas uses a centralized internal messaging system.

Allowed communication:

OWNER <-> TRADER
OWNER <-> ADMIN
OWNER <-> CO_ADMIN
OWNER <-> future permitted user

Non-owner users may communicate ONLY with the Owner.

Forbidden unless explicitly changed later:

TRADER <-> TRADER
ADMIN <-> TRADER
CO_ADMIN <-> TRADER
ADMIN <-> ADMIN
ADMIN <-> CO_ADMIN
other non-owner lateral messaging

Messages are permanent communication records.

Users cannot delete message history.

Archive is allowed but must not delete canonical messages.

Messaging belongs primarily to the user/trader identity rather than an
individual MT5 account.

